@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
title UC-02 安排诊疗预约
actor "前台接待" as reception
boundary "预约界面" as screen
control "预约控制器" as control
entity "资源日历" as calendar
entity "预约" as booking
reception -> screen: 提交预约(患者、时段)
screen -> control: 安排预约(方案、版本)
control -> calendar: 核验资源与资格()
calendar --> control: 返回校验结果
alt [资格或时段不满足]
control --> screen: 返回冲突原因
screen --> reception: 提示重新选时段
else [资格及时段均满足]
control -> calendar: 占用时段()
calendar --> control: 占用确认
control -> booking: 建立预约与历史()
booking --> control: 返回预约编号
control --> screen: 返回确认摘要
screen --> reception: 显示预约结果
end
@enduml
